 We are developing VK2809&#160;for the treatment of NASH, an indication for which there are no approved products. This makes it difficult to predict the timing and costs of the clinical development of VK2809 for the treatment of NASH.



 &#160;





 &#160;



 &#8226; 



 We face substantial competition, which may result in others discovering, developing or commercializing competing products before or more successfully than us.



 &#160;





